+# packet-plumber-v2-ambience — field notes
+
+- v2-ambience (2026-08-23): a seamless music-bed loop on a track with NO
+  beat-lockable phrase boundary = crossfade, never a hard cut — the
+  reproducible recipe: pick the highest spectral-similarity window
+  (8s-window cosine sim 0.76), then blend-at-end (last X=7.75s of the loop
+  = equal-power crossfade of tail into the file's own head); the residual
+  one-sample wrap discontinuity measures 0.048 peak. The WAV-intermediate
+  (24MB) must be .gitignored the same PR as the transform script that
+  writes it.
+- v2-ambience (2026-08-23): the T1 audio golden family (audio.dem /
+  audio_throttle / audio_spawn) pins the consumer's cosmetic-rng draw
+  pattern — a music bed stays golden-proof by adding ZERO draws and keeping
+  its duck envelope entirely in the device-gated flush/update half (the
+  harness mirror is a zero Audio; it never calls bed_update).
+- v2-ambience (2026-08-23): r1 review-swarm folds worth keeping — the duck
+  must be a RELATIVE reduction capped at 1.0 (a master tuned below the duck
+  level would otherwise be RAISED by ducking); mute must reset the duck
+  envelope (a pre-mute duck otherwise finishes recovery in silence and
+  unmute lands mid-ramp); a pure mirror flag (bed_paused) beside the
+  device-gated raylib pause/resume makes the mute branch headless-testable.
