+  `audio_flush` (device+gated playing half — the duck trigger hooks here),
+  `toggle_mute`. The bed adds fields + new procs in this file.
+- `app/main.odin` -- the frame loop: `au.audio_flush(&app.audio)` call site
+  (~line 480) is the bed-update anchor (per-frame, outside the run_live gate);
