+**Acceptance Criteria:**
+- Given a device with the OGG present, when the app runs, then the bed plays
+  from boot and wraps with no audible seam (125.6s loop; crossfade
+  construction, documented loop points).
+- Given wire clicks/spawn chimes/crisis stings firing, when the bed is
+  playing, then the SFX stay clearly audible over the ducked bed (duck
+  envelope: `MUSIC_DUCK_SECS` deep + `MUSIC_DUCK_RAMP_SECS` recovery).
+- Given Pause (5.3), when the sim freezes, then the bed keeps playing low
+  (soft-lower to `MUSIC_PAUSE_LEVEL`, never a hard cut); Game_Over keeps it
+  calm; Mute pauses it in place.
+- Given `MUSIC_VOLUME`, when the user tunes it by ear, then the named
+  constant is the single master-level knob (documented in README + code).
+- Given the full golden suite, when `tools/harness.sh run` runs, then every
+  T1/T2/replay check passes byte-identical — zero golden diffs (the bed adds
