+## Spec Change Log
+
+- 2026-08-23 (step-04 r1 review swarm, 3 findings folded): proc-name drift
+  — the spec named the pure envelope helper `bed_level_multiplier`; the
+  code ships `bed_duck_multiplier` (+ `bed_envelope_step`, `bed_level`,
+  `pending_any_plays`, and the `bed_paused` mirror flag, none in the
+  original Tasks). Amended the Tasks list to the real names + the r1 fold
+  additions (duck cap, mute envelope reset, boot fade, build-script
+  guards/sha256). Known-bad state avoided: a reviewer diffing spec against
